<title>USA: Hallwood sees about 93 pct shrs tendered.</title>
<headline>Hallwood sees about 93 pct shrs tendered.</headline>
<dateline>DALLAS 1997-06-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hallwood Group Inc said it has accepted for purchase 300,000 properly tendered shares of its common stock from its recently completed, self-tender offer and an additional 4,461 shares, in accordance with the proration provision contained in the offering documents.</p>
<p>This represents about 92.7 percent of the shares that were properly tendered, the company said.</p>
</text>
